 ex=("Why did Magadha become so powerful?",[("It had fertile land, so it could grow plenty of food.","Food supports an army."),("It had iron mines for tools and weapons.","Iron made strong tools."),("And rivers helped trade and travel. So it grew strong.","Rivers connected towns.")]),
 tb=("A friend says kings did not take taxes. How will you explain?",["Rulers collected a share of produce and money as tax.","This paid for armies, roads and officials."],["Assuming no taxes existed in ancient times."]),
